>>>> ===== Here's the function in all of its glory, use it if you like  
>>>> =====
>>>>
>>>> Here's a sample call:
>>>>
>>>> plotGenomeGraphReads(list(Sample1=reads.1, Sample2=reads.2),
>>>>   gene.id='ENSG00000116688', title="MFN2")
